 type="icon" > <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M9.725 17.325L4.875 12.5L6.15 11.2L9.725 14.775L17.85 6.67499L19.125 7.94999L9.725 17.325Z" fill="#101423"/> </svg></div><div class="se-title-text " size="h4" alignment="left"><h4 class="se-title heading-4">Cross-channel performance</h4><p class="se-text se-text_regular se-text_body"> Find connections between channels, analyze dependencies, and act on the right signals instead of isolated metrics</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="custom-text-image outer-spacing se-tabs__container"
